to me but I'm screaming an
saying, like,

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:49.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
"[ As Nate ] Leave me alone!
You know, anyway.

00:03:49.596 --> 00:03:52.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
